handle mutating JSON schemas

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.260
and streaming pipeline
with Square Enix.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.010
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.020
So, this is an
article written, it

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:08.690
looks like, in conjunction with
Square Enix, the game studio.

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:10.273
They make a lot of
really cool games--

00:04:10.273 --> 00:04:12.650
"Final Fantasy," "Deus
Ex," "NieR Automata"--

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.282
