00:04:14.282 --> 00:04:15.740
But they talk about,
basically, how

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.620
they ingest a wide
variety of JSON data

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.060
across a wide
variety of studios--

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.101
because they're made up
of a variety of studios--

00:04:22.101 --> 00:04:25.190
and how do they handle different
JSON schemas coming through,

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.679
and how to deal
with mutating JSON,

00:04:26.679 --> 00:04:28.970
and how to handle it when
you have multiple, basically,

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:31.256
people who are ingesting
data through this pipeline.

00:04:31.256 --> 00:04:32.630
It's a really cute
article that's

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.476
