the boss is the mutating JSON.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:40.700
And it's really adorable.

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.158
MELANIE WARRICK: And it has a
good diagram of the pipeline,

00:04:43.158 --> 00:04:45.590
as well as they have a link
at the bottom for those

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.020
who want to check out more
common usage patterns for Cloud

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:48.770
Dataflow.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.400
Great.

